  "ingredients": [
    "2 pounds sliced beef liver",
    "1.5 cups milk, or as needed",
    "0.25 cup butter, divided",
    "2 large Vidalia onions, sliced into rings",
    "2 cups all-purpose flour, or as needed",
    "salt and pepper to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/SnZeWj1utMFIEz73vNAansGTf38=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-JF-58942-Absolute-Best-Liver-and-Onions-Ingredients-74bbf2583eee425aab67c4f64fab6a9f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/58942/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Gently rinse liver slices under cold water and pat dry with paper towels. Place in a shallow dish; pour in enough milk to cover. Let stand while preparing onions, or set aside for longer if you have time. Soaking will remove any bitterness.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/BLMQwqo7u9VeVJcMR0TlMId6YBc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-JF-58942-Absolute-Best-Liver-and-Onions-Step-1-82aa8556480e4e098a00d9a22c701b33.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/58942/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt 2 tablespoons of butter in a large skillet over medium heat. Add onion rings; cook and stir in butter until tender and soft, about 3 to 5 minutes. Transfer onions into a bowl and set the skillet aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/lWcr2XaZ8k7imy-ZNfjzrN9Tgk8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-JF-58942-Absolute-Best-Liver-and-Onions-Step-2a-9f5ad76ccade4624bc0eefd26a91f61a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/58942/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place flour on a plate; season with salt and pepper. Remove the liver from the milk and discard the milk. Coat liver slices in flour mixture.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/5HBDSLaQ1DIT6v7Agb6CnHdBtI8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-JF-58942-Absolute-Best-Liver-and-Onions-Step-3-828136611f9c4ba0a165fc7f96bdcd23.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/58942/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt remaining 2 tablespoons of butter in the same skillet; increase heat to medium-high and fry coated liver slices until lightly browned, about 3 to 4 minutes on each side.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/DTYUhcgGkeJug-_tihFQUw9gITY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-JF-58942-Absolute-Best-Liver-and-Onions-Step-4-919c1ce32cd241aea64a3f44379315ed.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/58942/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Return onions to the skillet and reduce heat to medium; continue to cook until onions are heated through and liver is slightly pink inside, or longer to suit your taste.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/FeAOJUQJfr-lb39tOZzpv4XhKBA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-JF-58942-Absolute-Best-Liver-and-Onions-Step-5-ef9c31cd80e6413d998523b72c71f6f8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/58942/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_XSEH_U1X3c0SuS0k9EaqiRoPYw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-JF-58942-Absolute-Best-Liver-and-Onions-4x3-b7821f9c2ad44891a5888e7a5481fcf2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/58942/step_07.webp"
    }
